    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/a8d6b7a337797ee94638f5ce4b4477c7.avif?t=1734294499\" /></div><br><strong>COP BASTARD</strong> - a first-person old-school shooter where the action never lets up. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/8a511187d8cd05bd610663c7e4dfe090.poster.avif?t=1734294499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/8a511187d8cd05bd610663c7e4dfe090.webm?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/8a511187d8cd05bd610663c7e4dfe090.mp4?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Drawing inspiration from 90s action cinema, dive into the streets of Japan. Assume the role of a gritty detective hailing from Osaka, a cop entangled with the yakuza clans.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/43ce3ec46e48ed83a66ee3068faa218d.poster.avif?t=1734294499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/43ce3ec46e48ed83a66ee3068faa218d.webm?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/43ce3ec46e48ed83a66ee3068faa218d.mp4?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Loads of Sick Action:</strong><br>Engage in intense, non-stop shootouts to make your mark in this city. Shoot, shoot, shoot...ya know?<br></li><li><strong>Gripping Storyline</strong>:<br>Immerse yourself in the game and journey through an unpredictable narrative until the very end. The fate of the cop from Osaka will keep you guessing.<br></li><li><strong>Slick Graphics and Sounds</strong>:<br>The game's graphics and sounds are designed to fully immerse players in the story, making them feel like they're right in the thick of the action.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/eb9bbe4f35914e5e413a2caba034d193.poster.avif?t=1734294499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/eb9bbe4f35914e5e413a2caba034d193.webm?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/eb9bbe4f35914e5e413a2caba034d193.mp4?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/a8d6b7a337797ee94638f5ce4b4477c7.avif?t=1734294499\" /></div><br><strong>COP BASTARD</strong> - a first-person old-school shooter where the action never lets up. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/8a511187d8cd05bd610663c7e4dfe090.poster.avif?t=1734294499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/8a511187d8cd05bd610663c7e4dfe090.webm?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/8a511187d8cd05bd610663c7e4dfe090.mp4?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Drawing inspiration from 90s action cinema, dive into the streets of Japan. Assume the role of a gritty detective hailing from Osaka, a cop entangled with the yakuza clans.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/43ce3ec46e48ed83a66ee3068faa218d.poster.avif?t=1734294499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/43ce3ec46e48ed83a66ee3068faa218d.webm?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/43ce3ec46e48ed83a66ee3068faa218d.mp4?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Loads of Sick Action:</strong><br>Engage in intense, non-stop shootouts to make your mark in this city. Shoot, shoot, shoot...ya know?<br></li><li><strong>Gripping Storyline</strong>:<br>Immerse yourself in the game and journey through an unpredictable narrative until the very end. The fate of the cop from Osaka will keep you guessing.<br></li><li><strong>Slick Graphics and Sounds</strong>:<br>The game's graphics and sounds are designed to fully immerse players in the story, making them feel like they're right in the thick of the action.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/eb9bbe4f35914e5e413a2caba034d193.poster.avif?t=1734294499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/eb9bbe4f35914e5e413a2caba034d193.webm?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/eb9bbe4f35914e5e413a2caba034d193.mp4?t=1734294499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
